  - id: the_just_shall_live_by_faith
    displayName: The Just Shall Live by Faith
    flavorText: Paul teaches that a man is justified by faith in Jesus Christ, not
      by works of the law, declaring "the just shall live by faith."
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Refutes the Judaizers' demand that Gentile believers keep the Mosaic
      law to be justified before God, establishing that righteousness comes by faith
      in Christ, not by works of the law.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_galatians
    managerId: justification_by_faith_galatians
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
